FB2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IxU23k0wv0EQ7kNvwHvrwOk&_nc_oc=Adn_Q5AhES9VfnLCyYMkgntp-EZCOc8wSn0tjOGBicXTdpJ5bt-UYnotAPw8k-JYveU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwOTjUNK-7kUcjYrVNolXj-yf__RqDBP69Q-6NLkn5lXg&oe=69AEBCD7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fw7LBuyeqCYQ7kNvwGoCJzL&_nc_oc=Adn3ho9sotw2GSLBCCZTokpyJtA_4ej6iW5a5ZhExfsv8yBbIy2MKdmMrXT9ADddfBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzht2TWnv4RiiW_QqQ4uQvN-6_CgC9N5a8iywj92ubtLQ&oe=69AEC215"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qdRcKNPjaUEQ7kNvwF-Ar5f&_nc_oc=AdlnnhPqgK3hCeZq1STaJwwOM51O2MUCLc-6nHdvO63_7hF_4pXwQ4u_Etu8Bqh6Zvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzNTSz8k4LFEmtOkdnOwJ9v_FOiiM9Do-WHLN_105o1XA&oe=69AED5C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZr1RkAQ2k0Q7kNvwEPt8Cn&_nc_oc=AdmJ_7N5KTCrpVHLNSrm_1t-ljJYj6JnPfl5EJPOHbgBGpr6SdfvaeTKJ-ksYJTX5vM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyj6rKbvMIpZO2mCpzBYT1pJd1ZmIf-hS-MSro3DidYtw&oe=69AEBC44"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BMw5cL4tjFEQ7kNvwHSANkm&_nc_oc=AdnN9RB1RaSf0CryqXzgkFmxmrdTL7mFHfaPiDg07pJC4jOIhGxadyh1qrUmbAa-jlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwxHxxgbIGe1V8Y1vBAJK6y_GinSZFY_AA2ZPiDNz3SYA&oe=69AEB4A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 